1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:02,020
Bukan sebab pakej kita bagus,

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,940
sebab Allah yang panggil.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,620
Orang kan, kalau lalu dekat makam Rasulullah,

4
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,240
orang selalu buat apa, tuan-tuan?

5
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,240
SELFIE?

6
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,700
Di depan kubur Rasulullah SAW.

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,020
Ada orang, dia tak ada SELFIE.

8
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,363
Dia pergi Makkah, balik, tak…

9
00:00:16,363 --> 00:00:17,920
ada sekeping gambar pun.

10
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,340
Perkataan LABBAIK, LABBAIK…

11
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:21,820
Allah tu, Allah panggil.

12
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:22,800
Dia nak jawab panggil:

13
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,220
LABBAIK Allahumma LABBAIK.

14
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,080
Terasa dia dipanggil.

15
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:31,280
Sebab tu, bukan sebab kita duit banyak,

16
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:34,120
bukan sebab pakej kita bagus,

17
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,040
sebab Allah yang panggil.

18
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:38,640
Bila terasa dipanggil, lain.

19
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:41,040
Pernah kita bawa jemaah seorang.

20
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,860
Sampai-sampai, sampai balik,

21
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:46,080
tak ada shopping pun.

22
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:48,280
Tiap-tiap hari saya tengok…

23
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,780
dia dekat masjid, menangis.

24
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,500
Sebab saya akan bawa masuk ikut Madinah.

25
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:53,720
Lepas tu kita pergi ke Makkah,

26
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:56,420
sebab kita nak ikut cara Nabi pergi tu.

27
00:00:56,420 --> 00:00:58,260
Sebab Nabi bermula di Madinah.

28
00:00:58,260 --> 00:01:00,880
Nabi akan miqat di Bir Ali,

29
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,740
kat situ kita akan miqat.

30
00:01:02,740 --> 00:01:05,700
Nabi akan menuju ke Makkah, kita akan masuk.

31
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:07,262
Saya tak ambil pintu Malik…

32
00:01:07,262 --> 00:01:08,940
Fahad, pintu Malik Abdul Aziz.

33
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:11,320
Saya akan pergi pintu yang paling belakang tu.

34
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:12,980
Itu yang jemaah marah tu.

35
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:14,420
“Hotel kita kat sini lah,

36
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:15,660
kenapa pergi belakang?”

37
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:17,940
Belakang tu pintu Babus Salam.

38
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,237
Cara Nabi masuk Masjidil Haram,

39
00:01:20,237 --> 00:01:22,340
Nabi ikut pintu Babus Salam.

40
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:24,260
Pintu Malik Fahad, pintu Malik…

41
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:26,160
Abdul Aziz, zaman Nabi mana ada.

42
00:01:27,540 --> 00:01:31,780
Imam an-Nawawi, dia nak masuk ikut pintu lain.

43
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:33,080
Dia tegur oleh seorang budak:

44
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:35,027
“Tuan nak masuk Masjidil Haram,

45
00:01:35,027 --> 00:01:37,200
ikut pintu ni, pintu Babus Salam.

46
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:39,720
Saya baca dalam kitab Imam an-Nawawi,

47
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,880
sunat masuk Masjidil Haram…

48
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,660
ikut pintu Babus Salam.”

49
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:45,580
Malu Imam an-Nawawi.

50
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:46,980
Kitab tu dia yang tulis,

51
00:01:46,980 --> 00:01:48,480
budak tu tak kenal dia.

